  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You create a dueling ground: a glowing circle of runes around a 15-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point on the ground you touch. As part of the casting, you choose two willing creatures in the Sphere as the targets. The spell ends early if a creature other than a target enters the Sphere.</p><p>If a target drops to 0 Hit Points in the dueling ground, it becomes Stable and teleports to the nearest unoccupied space outside the circle. If a target would be killed outright by an effect that deals no damage, it instead drops to 0 Hit Points with the &amp;Reference[unconscious apply=false]{Unconscious} condition, is Stable, and teleports out in the same way.</p><p>When only one target is left inside, runes matching those of the circle flash briefly around its head like a crown.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> You can target one additional willing creature for each spell slot level above 2.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
